<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>/Hug Me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Jakeneutron, JuKayVid, Chi-Chi</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Neutron Nexus</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5Yhcv8YhbnG1cEtPlSPOSw</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.664" end="00:05.638">We had a long day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.638" end="00:07.899">All day we did play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.899" end="00:09.399">But now it’s time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.273" end="00:10.907">To say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.907" end="00:14.635">and be on our way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.635" end="00:17.708">It won't be forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.708" end="00:20.071">We'll still be together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.071" end="00:21.571">until next time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.275" end="00:22.775">Let's say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.643" end="00:24.143">The fun never ends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.044" end="00:25.794">when you've got a friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.794" end="00:27.294">So</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.690" end="00:28.190">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.062" end="00:30.879">Hug me to say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.879" end="00:33.931">It’s for friends like you &amp; I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.931" end="00:36.264">though I guess we got more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.264" end="00:38.315">Let's sing a bit before we say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.315" end="00:44.708">Bye Bye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.708" end="00:47.475">Remember when she saw all our friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.475" end="00:50.771">Remember when we counted to ten</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.771" end="00:52.882">Remember when she saw our friend (FINN)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.882" end="00:54.382">Bun Bun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.621" end="00:56.753">We learned the word QUITE with him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.753" end="00:59.467">We learned how to not be afraid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.467" end="01:01.787">We learned how the darkness can aid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.787" end="01:03.287">That fear of mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.194" end="01:04.694">So silly, right?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.438" end="01:06.062">And if I say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.062" end="01:07.696">It’s not like I’d DIE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.696" end="01:09.196">（RUN）</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.949" end="01:10.449">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.248" end="01:12.905">Hug me and goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.905" end="01:15.916">Gosh I wish we had more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.916" end="01:18.388">We could learn &amp; play all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.388" end="01:19.888">/WHAT SHALL WE CREATE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.253" end="01:21.049">/WHAT SHALL WE CREATEeeEeEeEeEE</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.049" end="01:22.549">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.150" end="01:24.869">Hug me and goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.869" end="01:27.664">Between friends like you &amp; I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.664" end="01:30.416">I’m gonna miss you friend of mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.416" end="01:31.934">Wish I didn't say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.934" end="01:39.934">Bye BYE/D：</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.581" end="01:50.212">I’ve got a secret I've being keeping inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.212" end="01:53.477">I never really wanted to say goodbye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.477" end="01:56.885">I can tell you feel the same way as me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.885" end="02:00.107">I've got the key for us to live happily</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.107" end="02:03.885">I need your help to make it last forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.885" end="02:08.351">I need your mind so we can never ever go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.351" end="02:13.809">This show’s I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.809" end="02:15.466">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.466" end="02:18.730">There'll be no goodbyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.730" end="02:21.965">They have figured it out, guys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.965" end="02:25.465">Look into the dark and take a dive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.465" end="02:27.512">And we'll play forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.512" end="02:29.012">“Are you listening??”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.686" end="02:30.853">“You NEED to turn this off RIGHT NOW!”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.853" end="02:32.353">“It’s ALL a trap!”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.199" end="02:34.512">“If you don't turn this off right now you're gonna be stuck f-”</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.512" end="02:36.137">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.137" end="02:38.942">I have seen the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.942" end="02:42.488">We can live in paradise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.488" end="02:45.990">You've just gotta give them your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.990" end="02:48.223">So trust me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.223" end="02:51.316">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.316" end="02:54.834">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.834" end="03:01.852">Hug me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.852" end="03:03.757" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hug me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.757" end="03:06.457" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(There'll be no goodbye)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.457" end="03:09.975" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(They have figured it out, guys)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.975" end="03:12.920" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Look into the dark and take a dive)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.920" end="03:16.920" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And we'll play forever)</p></div></body></tt>